### Trigger BOM matching
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/match
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get user global preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update user global preferences
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferred_currency": "AUD",
  "preferred_distributors": ["DigiKey", "Mouser"]
}

### Get project preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Set project-level override (currency only — leave distributors to inherit from global)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "preferred_currency": "USD",
  "preferred_distributors": null
}